        (size 2.54 2.54) bold)
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6eb0b46d-86e4-40b0-89f0-a41834fe4e07"))
  (text "9  Sensor boards SB1, SB2 (break off; wired to J5, J6)"
    (at 22 370 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2.54 2.54) bold)
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "db4083a5-c05a-4d14-93f6-6b07cbefc3af"))
