      (font
        (size 2.54 2.54) bold)
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "10da4ba4-acf8-49b1-bb86-f7b9985591d1"))
  (text "One board for both dryers, every part assembled by JLCPCB. The 1-roll BOM leaves off the 2-roll-only parts (field Build)."
    (at 260 330.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "2a107904-9ad8-4c36-9da7-81e61d90dc42"))
  (text "U1 antenna at the board edge: no copper, parts or traces under it. USB is data only: plug in 12 V while flashing."
    (at 260 336.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "40834eed-e9c3-43a3-a432-2b672c8ffc2c"))
  (text "SB1 (U14, C37, J18) and SB2 (U15, C39, J19) are small boards on break-off tabs: their nets (SB1_*, SB2_*) reach the board only through the harness."
    (at 260 342.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "7e9d1721-6c1c-40b0-9ce9-c3cd1065747c"))
  (text "U10/U11: 39k/10k on VREF = 1.0 V -> about 0.72 A RMS with 0.11 R sense resistors. Exposed pad to GND with vias."
    (at 260 348.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a15c7949-0f77-42fb-b1d1-2d399d6cdf1d"))
  (text "Heater path J1 -> F1 -> TB2 -> Q1 carries 12.5 A: wide pours, 2 oz copper, copper area under Q1."
    (at 260 354.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "119170f6-f312-4f5c-aa00-7331a4623e0c"))
